      "expected_outcome": "A declared name that is not the name of the folder the Skill sits in is refused with a blocking finding naming both; a name with no author folder to compare, and a package with no name, are not judged on the folder.",
      "level": "unit",
      "status": "planned",
      "check": "go test -count=1 -v -run '^TestANameThatIsNotTheFolderNameIsRefused$|^TestAPackageMissingItsNameIsNotAlsoRefusedForItsFolderName$' ./internal/shared/skillpkg/"
    },
    {
      "id": "rule-one-import-admits-a-name-once",
      "source_type": "acceptance-criterion",
      "source_id": "duplicate-rule-intact",
      "also_covers": [
        {
          "source_type": "rule",
          "source_id": "one-import-admits-a-name-once"
        }
      ],
      "expected_outcome": "Of two folders of one source sharing a base name and declaring it, the first is admitted and the second refused with the duplicate-name finding; a folder whose declared name is not its own is refused for that instead.",
      "level": "unit",
      "status": "planned",
      "check": "go test -count=1 -v -run '^TestPlanImportRefusesASecondSkillClaimingANameAlreadyTaken$|^TestPlanImportRefusesASkillWhoseNameIsNotItsFolderName$' ./internal/skill/admission/"
